<title>FRANCE: Paris Bourse to have closure fix at 1520 GMT.</title>
<headline>Paris Bourse to have closure fix at 1520 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Paris Bourse said that traders would be able to enter orders into the computer system from 1515 GMT and that there would be a fixing for closing prices at 1520 GMT. A spokesman said the special measure was due to the suspension of trade at 1440 GMT following a problem with the price quote system.</p>
</text>
